<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Dog Petting Farm</Major>
    <Description>Simple auto dog petter for anyone that wants to grind the "Good Boy Protocol", if you want to have a specific stat number ;) or make people laugh that you pet the robodog (insert insanely high number).

How to use: Just look at the dog then press the macro key

Potential issues: If you are having trouble you may need to change the mouse Y axis movement, I set it up for 800 dpi and 1.5 ingame so change if necessary.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 700 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 1000 ms
MoveR 0 2000
Delay 100 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Destiny 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>